Time period: Time of publication.
Production volume: 1.2 Mio. m3 per year
Sampling: Literature and own estimations 
Extrapolations: From single data to Swiss situation.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_27a4a175-8e34-3f04-aa68-dc9b45e87514.xml</text>
